                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "1. This shutdown is all about health care.\n\nRepublicans have created this health care crisis that includes hospitals shutting down, long term care facilities closing, and tens of millions of people either losing their health care or seeing their health care costs skyrocket.",
