                "text": "As this shutdown continues, it\u2019s people like Michelle who pay the price.\n\nShe\u2019s run her small business in Cincinnati for 24 years. If healthcare subsidies expire, her premiums could rise by $800 \u2014 enough to close her doors. \ud83e\uddf5\u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/bobCKbXZZc",
