                "text": "We had lunch with SW Ohioans to talk about what\u2019s at stake if Congress doesn\u2019t extend the ACA tax credits.\n\nHearing their stories makes it real - health insurance will skyrocket, and thousands could lose coverage altogether. https://t.co/6yiRrECpHk",
