                "text": "\u201cThat\u2019s going to take away from gas, food, and everything else we need to live.\u201d\n\nMarquita faces tough choices when open enrollment starts Nov 1. With health insurance costs skyrocketing, she\u2019s worried about keeping the coverage her family and employees rely on.\n\nThis fight is for people like Marquita.",
