                "text": "Projected 2026 ACA insurance premiums are now online (https://t.co/L63TsMqo9x). \n\nWithout tax credits, an average family of four would pay more than double for coverage. Families can\u2019t afford that.\n\nCongress needs to reach a deal to protect healthcare. https://t.co/CVA1EQkSDc",
